# Restore the tracked object to a known pose without restarting the simulator.
# Simulation time is deliberately NOT reset: /clock consumers and the trial
# validity guard both rely on sim_time increasing monotonically for the life of
# the process, and a reset epoch would be indistinguishable from the silent
# auto-reset MuJoCo performs when it diverges.
float64 x          # world position; ignored when use_spawn is true
float64 y
float64 yaw_deg    # rotation about world z
bool use_spawn     # restore the pose the scene spawned at
---
bool success
string message
float64 sim_time   # simulation time at which the reset was applied
